[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767312606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115115#issuecomment-3767312606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115115","id":3767312606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gjKDe","user":{"login":"patrykkalinowski","id":7796424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTY0MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7796424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T09:27:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T09:27:41Z","body":"I did test it with Quest 3 controllers through Meta Link, where in my case palm bone position is (0, 0, 0) relative to Skeleton3D instead of where it should be.\r\n\r\nNot sure if this is the same category of error, but unfortunately, it's NOT fixed.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767312606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767649474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115115#issuecomment-3767649474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115115","id":3767649474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gkcTC","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T10:41:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T10:41:11Z","body":"Thanks, that gives me something more to go on, I'll do more testing in the morning.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3767649474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776510231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115115#issuecomment-3776510231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115115","id":3776510231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hGPkX","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T07:06:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T07:06:55Z","body":"Hmm, its working fine for me with meta link. Note that the palm bone should be at 0,0,0 as we use a parent XRNode3D node to position the hand at that location. This so you can override the positioning to take walls and tables and such into account.\r\n\r\n(see also https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/xr/openxr_hand_tracking_demo )","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776510231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776772124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115115#issuecomment-3776772124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115115","id":3776772124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hHPgc","user":{"login":"patrykkalinowski","id":7796424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTY0MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7796424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T08:24:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T08:28:06Z","body":"On Meta runtime with controllers, Skeleton3D position is not on the palm bone (see grey box):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"502\" height=\"368\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2026-01-21 090551\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8276f87c-eccb-4930-8ce8-a8e0aa9c0dc9\" />\r\n<img width=\"408\" height=\"398\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2026-01-21 090610\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce97de91-470d-4b1d-93f5-41fc903844b6\" />\r\n\r\nSo, if I add palm bone to skeleton from hand tracking demo, the mesh gets distorted as palm bone vertices are pulled to (0, 0, 0) global pose:\r\n<img width=\"1584\" height=\"1228\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2026-01-21 091202\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/888c26cf-d6da-4122-ac13-7c1672fe1793\" />\r\n<img width=\"434\" height=\"388\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2026-01-21 091435\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce9f980d-de81-4fe1-99e0-14aca4dd3110\" />\r\n<img width=\"478\" height=\"384\" alt=\"Zrzut ekranu 2026-01-21 092745\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c88b67e-5a6b-4a4c-b503-5001fffba1f1\" />\r\n\r\nGranted, I am using PalmBone in skeleton which is not officialy supported in SkeletonProfileHumanoid so I guess it should be on me to get rid of it and just use LeftHand/RightHand bones. \r\n\r\nI'm letting you know because this is the only runtime I tested where it happens and others (ex. SteamVR) are positioning Skeleton3D node on actual palm bone position.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776772124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777288325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115115#issuecomment-3777288325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115115","id":3777288325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hJNiF","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T10:19:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T10:19:43Z","body":"Ah, I get it though I don't think there is much we can do about that. Indeed we never noticed because the bone is not in our skeleton, but it is part of the data in OpenXR and as its the root node in OpenXR, its where we place the base of the hand.\r\n\r\nIf Meta puts it outside of the hand like that....\r\n\r\nOne of the things I've been wanting to do is allowing you to nominate one of the action poses as the root and we just offset everything accordingly, that makes a lot more sense as well in combining controller and hand tracking. \r\nProblem is that this requires dependable implementations of the hand interaction profile or normal hand tracking will fail. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3777288325/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]